# Go sources and module files are LF in the repo and in the working tree -
# gofmt/go tooling is LF-sensitive, and core.autocrlf=true would otherwise
# re-check them out as CRLF on Windows and fail the wg-go gate (BI-PF-0412 RCCA).
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# Backlog shared stores (BI-PF-1176): never text-merge.
# - append-only history records: built-in union keeps both sides' lines.
**/backlog/history/*.jsonl merge=union
# - DERIVED lean indexes: regenerate from items/ via the pf-derived merge driver (install_hooks.py).
**/backlog/open.json merge=pf-derived
**/backlog/closed.json merge=pf-derived
